  {
    "content": "---
okf_version: '0.2'
---

# Resource types

* [DockerConfig](/types/DockerConfig.md) - Docker::Compose::Config
* [Dockerfile](/types/Dockerfile.md) - Docker::Dockerfile
* [DockerSecret](/types/DockerSecret.md) - Docker::Compose::Secret
* [Network](/types/Network.md) - Docker::Compose::Network
* [Service](/types/Service.md) - Docker::Compose::Service
* [Volume](/types/Volume.md) - Docker::Compose::Volume

# Rules

* [DKRD001](/rules/DKRD001.md) - Service uses :latest or untagged image — specify an explicit version tag
* [DKRD002](/rules/DKRD002.md) - Named volume is declared but not mounted by any service
* [DKRD003](/rules/DKRD003.md) - Service exposes SSH port (22) externally — this is a security risk
* [DKRD010](/rules/DKRD010.md) - apt-get install without --no-install-recommends adds unnecessary packages
* [DKRD011](/rules/DKRD011.md) - Prefer COPY over ADD when not fetching URLs or extracting archives
* [DKRD012](/rules/DKRD012.md) - Dockerfile's final stage has no USER instruction, or ends on USER root — container runs as root
* [DKRD013](/rules/DKRD013.md) - Whole build context copied before a dependency install — every source change re-runs the install
* [DKRD014](/rules/DKRD014.md) - RUN needs root but comes after USER switched to a non-root user
* [DKRD015](/rules/DKRD015.md) - More than one CMD or ENTRYPOINT in a stage — only the last one takes effect
* [DKRD016](/rules/DKRD016.md) - COPY --from names a stage that is not defined before it
* [DKRD017](/rules/DKRD017.md) - ARG before the first FROM is not used by any FROM or stage
* [DKRD018](/rules/DKRD018.md) - Relative WORKDIR before any absolute WORKDIR in the stage
* [DKRD019](/rules/DKRD019.md) - ADD fetches a remote URL without --checksum
* [DKRD020](/rules/DKRD020.md) - apt-get update in a different RUN from apt-get install — the install can use a stale package index
* [DKRS001](/rules/DKRS001.md) - No Latest Tag
* [DKRS002](/rules/DKRS002.md) - Per-kind Dockerfile fields written in a different order
",
